\ Combinator-bounded call site in AOT runtime-image mode. The generic's
\ parameter is bound by an intersection combinator (addable & printable);
\ the call site emits the combinator satisfies-and-dispatch helper-call, and
\ the loader reconstructs the combinator descriptor from the image's
\ combinator slot table at startup, so the helper performs a genuine
\ satisfies-check.
\
\ The intersection's addable element requires bump-it, so the combinator
\ provably guarantees the generic's method and the call site is bounded. No
\ bump-it method is registered for fixnum, so fixnum fails the addable element
\ of the intersection and the check raises a protocol error.

addable:   protocol{ bump-it: } ;
printable: protocol{ show-it: } ;
bump-it:   generic ( x: addable & printable -- n ) [ drop 0 ] ;

\ Combinator-bounded call site: compiled output emits the combinator
\ satisfies-and-dispatch helper.
bounded-caller: ( x: addable & printable -- n ) [ bump-it ] ;

1 bounded-caller .
